\n50\t- Verify via keyboard-only walkthrough of each of the four flows that it can be\n51\t  completed end to end.\n52\t- Out of scope: screen-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard fixes require,\n53\t  and flows outside the four audited ones.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Each of the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model\n58\t  deployment, pipeline run submission) can be completed end to end using\n59\t  keyboard only, verified by a keyboard-only walkthrough of each flow.\n60\t- No focus traps remain in the audited flows, and focus is no longer lost in\n61\t  the modals cited by the audit.\n62\t- No control in the audited flows is unreachable or inoperable by keyboard.\n63\t- Visible focus indicators are consistent across all controls in the audited\n64\t  flows.\n65\t- Every defect enumerated in the audit report for the four flows is fixed or\n66\t  has an explicit, recorded disposition.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- **HLR-1 (P1)**: The four audited core flows are fully operable by keyboard,\n71\t  with no focus traps or unreachable controls.\n72\t- **HLR-2 (P1)**: Visible focus indicators are consistent across the audited\n73\t  flows. Bundled with HLR-1: both are remediated over the same UI surfaces by\n74\t  the same team from the same audit defect enumeration; splitting would force a\n75\t  second pass over the same components.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc6f68a8d20394eb","agent_id":"a43863254870e327d","session_id":"91910129-2353-4937-9db9-1b78a5e38d43","uuid":"b04e32cc-8f70-43c3-87ba-3ad2746333dd","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:28:49.644Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b32936bf40e93dba","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
